---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Jamie Geddes — a software engineer writing about .NET, Delphi, APIs and the cloud."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Hello, I'm Jamie Geddes</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose about-body">
      <p>
        I'm a professional software engineer with many years of development
        experience, working with a mix of desktop, web and cloud technologies.
        My background is varied — everything from writing code for embedded
        devices through to modern web applications and services hosted in the
        cloud. I'm an avid learner and couldn't live without my
        <a href="https://www.pluralsight.com/">Pluralsight</a> subscription.
      </p>
      <p>
        This blog is where I write up the things I build, the tools I use, and
        whatever else is keeping me curious.
      </p>

      <h2>Languages</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>C#</li>
        <li>JavaScript / Node.js</li>
        <li>Delphi</li>
        <li>PHP</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Platforms</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Microsoft Azure — Web Apps, WebJobs and Azure Functions, Cosmos DB,
          SQL Database, Service Bus, Blob storage and shared access signatures,
          Application Insights monitoring
        </li>
        <li>
          Amazon Web Services — S3, EC2, DynamoDB, RDS, API Gateway, Lambda,
          Route 53
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Other</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Web API</li>
        <li>OpenID Connect</li>
        <li>SQL Server &amp; MySQL</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Tooling</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Visual Studio &amp; Visual Studio Code</li>
        <li>JetBrains IDEs</li>
        <li>Git</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Find me elsewhere</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/JamieGeddes">GitHub</a></li>
      </ul>

      <hr />

      <p class="colophon">
        This site is a static blog built with
        <a href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a> and deployed on
        <a href="https://pages.cloudflare.com/">Cloudflare Pages</a>. The source
        lives on <a href="https://github.com/JamieGeddes/jamiegeddes.io">GitHub</a>.
        Banner imagery, where used, is by Scott Marsland under the
        <a
          href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/deed.en"
          >Creative Commons Attribution 3.0</a
        > licence —
        <a
          href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Forth_Rail_Bridge_-_panoramio_(2).jpg"
          >original source</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-head {
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5.5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.022em;
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
  }
  .colophon {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
</style>
